   # QR Drop privacy policy

   QR Drop transfers files directly between your phone and your computer.
   Files never pass through or are stored on any server.

   The QR Drop server only helps the two devices find each other. It briefly
   handles a random one-time room code and connection setup messages, and uses
   your IP address only to limit abuse. Nothing is logged for tracking, no
   analytics are used, and no data is sold or shared.

   The extension stores only your settings (server address and preferences)
   in your browser's sync storage.

   Contact: your-email@example.com
